        <description>Fiddle bridge wire schema 2: typed Off (On+64) and revision beacon on KS126/KS127. Note durations pinned to 100% (written lengths). Pending Dorico host acceptance. Orchestral woodwinds: 36 conduits, 25 bases, 64 add-ons. Specification SHA256: 47f12d35bc4efce2bc5343fa929af80abc158adecab2c08d662d0544e8d94a49</description>
